on\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 20 ft</li>  <li>Fly 40 ft (Good)</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> bite +5 (1d8+4)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 5 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 17</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 15</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 13</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 14</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 6</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+3</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +7</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 19  </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Alertness</li>  <li>Stealthy</li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Fly +9</li>  <li>Perception +12</li>  <li>Stealth +4</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   any temperate or tropical <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or colony (3-8)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  incidental   <br />  </div>      <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nThe dire bat is usually found lairing in desolate areas, resting in caves or other secluded areas during the day and taking to the skies in search of prey at night. This immense creature has an average wingspan of 15 feet and weighs roughly 200 pounds.\n\nThe dire bat generally doesn't shelter in groups larger than eight, often living a solitary life. A dire bat prefers feeding on livestock and herd animals.\n\nDire Bat Animal Companion Starting Statistics: Size Medium; Speed 20 ft., fly 40 ft. (good); AC +0 natural armor; Attack bite (1d6); Ability Scores Str 9, Dex 17, Con 9, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 6; Special Qualities blindsense 40 ft.\n\n7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack bite (1d8); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Dire Bat (CR 2)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 2 \nXP 600 \nN Large animal  \nInit +2; Senses blindsense 40 ft.; Perception +12   \nDefense   \nAC 14, touch 11, flat-footed 12 (+2 Dex, +3 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 22 (4d8+4)\n\nFort +5, Ref +6, Will +3   \nOffense   \nSpd 20 ft., fly 40 ft. (good)\n\nMelee bite +5 (1d8+4)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.   \nStatistics   \nStr 17, Dex 15, Con 13, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 6 \nBase Atk +3; CMB +7; CMD 19 \nFeats Alertness, Stealthy \nSkills Fly +9, Perception +12, Stealth +4; Racial Modifiers +4 Perception when using blindsense   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  any temperate or tropical \nOrganization solitary, pair, or colony (3-8)\n\nTreasure incidental   \nDescription\n\nThe dire bat is usually found lairing in desolate areas, resting in caves or other secluded areas during the day and taking to the skies in search of prey at night. This immense creature has an average wingspan of 15 feet and weighs roughly 200 pounds.\n\nThe dire bat generally doesn't shelter in groups larger than eight, often living a solitary life. A dire bat prefers feeding on livestock and herd animals.\n\nDire Bat Animal Companion Starting Statistics: Size Medium; Speed 20 ft., fly 40 ft. (good); AC +0 natural armor; Attack bite (1d6); Ability Scores Str 9, Dex 17, Con 9, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 6; Special Qualities blindsense 40 ft.\n\n7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack bite (1d8); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":2},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":2},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":4},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"slt":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"spl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ste":{"ability":"dex","rt":